    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a bit too strict, don't you think? Some employees feel that if they aren't allowed to express their values, it actually hurts inclusivity because they feel they have to hide who they are. Can you add a section that explains why limiting expression is actually better for diversity and inclusion in the long run?",
